							<li>Survivor Surveys</li>
							<li>CrowdBuying</li>
							<li>Collaborative Home Rebuilding</li>
						</ol>
                        <p>
                            We are not asking for donations at this time. This project is being bootstrapped by a team of volunteers with their own time and money.
                        </p>
					</p>
